<node id="Transformer Model Architecture Diagram (image)">
  <data key="d0">Transformer Model Architecture Diagram (image)</data>
  <data key="d1">image</data>
  <data key="d2">This diagram illustrates the architecture of the Transformer model, highlighting the encoder-decoder structure and the use of multi-head attention mechanisms. It serves as a visual representation of the concepts discussed in the surrounding text, which emphasizes the model's efficiency and advantages over traditional recurrent neural networks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-23de75d3736d5e8a81117a9717a0698f</data>
