<node id="Multi-Head Attention Equation (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Multi-Head Attention Equation (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">This equation defines the Multi-Head Attention mechanism, which enhances the model's ability to focus on different parts of the input sequence simultaneously, improving performance in various sequence transduction tasks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f7d457588ae4f4784ed8facd71161b0e</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1763837951</data>
</node>
<node id="Feed-Forward Neural Network Layer (equation)">
  <data key="d0">Feed-Forward Neural Network Layer (equation)</data>
  <data key="d1">equation</data>
  <data key="d2">This equation defines a feed-forward neural network layer, crucial for transforming input representations in the Transformer model. It combines linear transformations and non-linear activations to enhance the model's capacity to learn complex mappings, thereby improving performance in sequence transduction tasks.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-14245555e2dad23a0c4ca3a0c65d5fc1</data>
  <data key="d4">attention.pdf</data>
  <data key="d5">1763837951</data>
</node>
